    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc96f67299167cf92ee47b3a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不是说在德比『最幸运的马娘才能获胜』吗？\n训练员就是要去确认白仁有没有运气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef99cb2590f12280be520b3025f5e164b75f1be3ca3e911e5ca1ebebfea1d611",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0004/storytimeline_020004031.json",
      "json_path": [
