      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我现在连第二冠的德比都还没跑。\n何谈什么自信呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0427c1fff46e7d73df64d80d79813c5e6883423de8b0a079a3aac86683af6553",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
